WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A familiar scene: you open one more tab before you have begun.
A task seems simple until it demands your attention.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
In a famous experiment, an unexpected visitor crossed a basketball game.
Some viewers concentrating on passes didn't report it.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
A scheduled twelve-minute pause will not make anyone immune.
But the routine itself can be worth trying.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 is one commercial audio option. Its seller lists different
course levels and sound versions. Stronger promises lack direct proof.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the independent guide. Try a free routine first.
Then decide whether a paid recording suits you.
